<title>USA: Allied Irish Banks names Quinn chairman.</title>
<headline>Allied Irish Banks names Quinn chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Irish Banks Plc said it named Lochlann Quinn, a non-executive director of the bank, to the post of chairman, effective January 1.</p>
<p>The company said it had announced earlier the retirement, effective December 31, 1996, of James Culliton as chairman and non-executive director.</p>
